WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.995
<v Leo>I just inherited TA-05, background checks.

00:00:04.015 --> 00:00:05.181
<v Leo>Where do I start?

00:00:05.201 --> 00:00:07.950
<v Ava>Five steps, and the first one comes with coffee.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.396
<v Ava>Here they are.

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:13.936
<v Ava>Step one is a 90-minute workshop with the people who actually do the work.

00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:17.614
<v Leo>So not just the person who wrote the procedure in 2015?

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:18.261
<v Ava>Right.

00:00:18.281 --> 00:00:22.079
<v Ava>Pro tip: walk one real, recent case from start to finish.

00:00:22.729 --> 00:00:26.687
<v Ava>Step two: map a swimlane, one lane per role, starting with the trigger.

00:00:26.707 --> 00:00:30.484
<v Leo>Tasks are boxes, and every "it depends" becomes a decision?

00:00:30.504 --> 00:00:31.327
<v Ava>Exactly.

00:00:31.347 --> 00:00:34.609
<v Ava>Follow every branch to the end, even the awkward ones.

00:00:36.059 --> 00:00:40.340
<v Ava>Watch out for the classic trap: mapping the ideal, not what really happens.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.106
<v Leo>Guilty.

00:00:41.126 --> 00:00:45.054
<v Leo>My last map had zero exceptions and a very happy unicorn.

00:00:45.074 --> 00:00:47.682
<v Ava>If it really takes three weeks, write three weeks.

00:00:48.332 --> 00:00:49.735
<v Ava>Step three: controls.

00:00:49.755 --> 00:00:52.273
<v Ava>What gets checked, by whom, with what evidence.

00:00:52.293 --> 00:00:56.123
<v Leo>Like no background check before the candidate signs consent?

00:00:56.143 --> 00:00:59.134
<v Ava>Yes, and the e-signature timestamp is the evidence.

00:00:59.154 --> 00:01:02.270
<v Ava>Key or SOX controls need a control review.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:06.647
<v Ava>Step four: country notes, only where local law changes a step.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:08.702
<v Leo>Okay, give me a real example.

00:01:08.722 --> 00:01:12.324
<v Ava>California bans criminal checks before a conditional offer.

00:01:12.344 --> 00:01:16.233
<v Ava>In China, private employers can't get official criminal records.

00:01:16.883 --> 00:01:18.271
<v Ava>Step five: submit.

00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:21.689
<v Ava>The process chain ends with the Head of HR Operations.

00:01:21.709 --> 00:01:24.403
<v Leo>So I refresh my inbox every four minutes?

00:01:24.423 --> 00:01:25.210
<v Ava>No need.

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:27.833
<v Ava>The Approvals page shows which step it's on.

00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:33.429
<v Ava>Workshop, map, controls, country notes, submit.

00:01:33.449 --> 00:01:35.645
<v Ava>Reality first, improvements second.

00:01:35.665 --> 00:01:36.996
<v Leo>And no unicorns.

00:01:37.016 --> 00:01:39.940
<v Leo>Next time: who actually clicks approve?
